6522426", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75210393_852485259855759_6019629505745872437_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4ji_xaGQJwgQ7kNvwEoZ2dC&_nc_oc=Ado0d91pwMJ_vBsJz5DGq3gzP0noVExo5lcQr9_xv6_cC6B3fJWWbsg39VBbDgDVuSE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG4B_Nh-cjE-RCxOy8-fkEPQW4F1OS-lFZH7vzKEEm9bg&oe=6A859C5B"}, {"file_name": "sc1.png", "id": "1698965373936946", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982551_1698965377270279_7553645442698234559_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kZQPPdRLzRQQ7kNvwGD2xQO&_nc_oc=AdoDCQnwJ_wEM9VSLVFgJAsZ3uon2cQ7f044_KUJvpfMUgVi3rinZi5sVl5FZi7AQG0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHNDlX4mQZsvvgt3M_0PQrAl7gkkFB1ZjFgdPEWF-2alQ&oe=6A858CA1"}, {"file_name": "sc3.png", "id": "362227642863079", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_362227646196412_4627867009706605201_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=odJPKKlAHVwQ7kNvwEPjqTD&_nc_oc=AdowWb9HJUfINDdv3ZC_DJUcbLiPc6xqbxI82maAhZwt5OIo9d0O3B-TOTcbyZoKaCM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQG_HrXHGtLPmjXiU5-2jtf4PxGAgNiQKAp9dLHmEBxppw&oe=6A85796F"}, {"file_name": "sc5.png", "id": "167386486400512", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982562_167386489733845_2832025039911865533_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rmSO_Bno1xIQ7kNvwGdoyb7&_nc_oc=AdqDipuQe22bJaEJ_xxZtcXVF72HfNRewGSVUEgNC99_3AOaOZwPkv-TkzcqadqFjaA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF0boQx-lwPy3zuxnI7Zb5d8fSgDNE28TS1gVwqlvvewA&oe=6A857912"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "sc4.png", "id": "860094495571873", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240101_860094502238539_6759068810652291731_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K9MaLND9BucQ7kNvwGP4E8W&_nc_oc=AdoQk8lCYoJrtySvzZKuo73UTlzwJ2BhuWOqPA0vztRLhc5zinBJGa8JhpKEiA3nPAM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHs6n9XGWRpwaw8DSDcJq9HZ-2WcdseO6LyD-ImQFurBg&oe=6A8582BD"}, "display_name": "Ball smasher", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. \n\nWhether you prefer the satisfying thud of a baseball bat connecting with a ball or the raw power of using your fists, the ball smasher offers a unique and cathartic way to let off steam. \n\nIt transforms the act of stress relief into a physical and engaging activity. So, the next time stress looms, head to the ball smasher and unleash your frustration on those unsuspecting balls. It's not just a stress reliever; it's a fun and dynamic approach to coping with life's pressures, promoting a healthier and more balanced mindset. \n\nTake a swing, make a hit, and feel the tension melt away as you engage in this unconventional yet effective stress-busting activity.", "short_description": "Ball smasher aims at stress reduction. \n\nGrab any of the weapons: boxing gloves, baseball bat, sledgehammer, shovel, cricket bat, tennis bat, or your fists and smash some balls. \n\nThis unconventional method provides a physical outlet for pent-up tension, allowing individuals to release stress in a controlled environment. The variety of available tools caters to different preferences, ensuring a personalized experience. "}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://artisoft.pl/policies/bs_v1.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Artisoft", "support_website_url": null, "websi